<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with Qantas Customer Care.<br />
<br />
I’m very sorry to hear about the circumstances of your trip with us on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<strong><em>If fare requesting refund, use:</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Our Community Fares</strong><br />
<br />
We know there are times when our customers need to travel at short notice due to personal situations, so we offer discounted ‘Community Fares’ on our domestic network.<br />
<br />
These give our Contact Centre staff the flexibility to offer customers a reduction on higher fares, which are often the only seats left when booking travel at the last minute.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If staff said to book online, add:</em></strong><br />
<br />
We often have discounted tickets available on our website&nbsp;that are cheaper than these special fares, and if they are still available, our staff will usually direct customers to book directly on our website.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If refunding fare difference, add:</strong></em><br />
<br />
I’ve spoken to our ticketing department and have arranged a refund of ${{{Case.Recovery_Value__c}}}, which is the difference between the fare you paid and the Community Fare price of this ticket. This will be refunded to the original form of payment in approximately 7 business days.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If refunding change fees, add:</em></strong><br />
<br />
I’ve checked your booking and can see that the amount you were charged was correct. Due to your compassionate situation, I’ve arranged a refund of the &lt;service/change&gt; fee.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If not refunding fare difference, add:</strong></em><br />
<br />
Red e-Deals and Classic award bookings are not eligible for a Community Fare discount, so I’m sorry we’re unable to meet your request for a refund.<br />
<br />
Please let me know if you'd like me to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with any claim.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If not refunding change fees, add:&nbsp;</strong></em><br />
<br />
When our fares come with special conditions or restrictions, we make sure our customers understand what they are before they complete their booking.<br />
<br />
I’ve checked your booking notes, and they show that &lt;you agreed to the conditions when booking on our website / the conditions of your fare were explained to you upon purchase&gt;.<br />
<br />
This means I’m unable to meet your request for a refund for the amount you were charged to change your ticket.<br />
<br />
<strong>We’re here to help</strong><br />
<br />
Please let me know if you'd like me to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with any claim – we’re here to help.</body>
</html>